DTEND:20260903T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T110827Z
UID:6a857985-ded8-5899-bfe4-ef36fdb661d8
DESCRIPTION:Is American democracy doomed? Robert Reich doesn’t think so
 \, even though he is more than capable of pointing out how it has fallen s
 hort and is being challenged by powerful anti-democratic forces. He says w
 e can reclaim a sense of community and a democratic capitalism based on Am
 erican ideals we still have the power to salvage.\n\nMore info & tickets: 
