BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Inside China’s Secret Prisons with Veteran China Expert Orville 
 Schell
DTSTART:20260904T010000Z
DTEND:20260904T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T110827Z
UID:e24d7260-b259-5b67-86a0-5162c378dc12
DESCRIPTION:For decades\, scholar and journalist Orville Schell has been o
 ne of the nation’s leading experts on China. The author of numerous book
 s on China\, Schell runs the Center on U.S.-China Relations at the Asia So
 ciety in New York. \nIn his new book\, Inside China’s Secret Prisons\, 
 Schell recounts the extraordinary investigation that uncovered China’s p
 rison labor network\, and the personal cost of reporting the truth. \n\nM
 ore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-09-03/ins
 ide-chinas-secret-prisons-veteran-china-expert-orville-schell
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, 110 The Embarcade
 ro\, San Francisco\, CA
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-09-03/inside-chinas-secre
 t-prisons-veteran-china-expert-orville-schell
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Imperfect Circles Discussion Group at the Orinda Library
DTSTART:20260904T013000Z
DTEND:20260904T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T110827Z
UID:8dcd06e4-e7aa-5c14-8090-cc07b8aa7425
DESCRIPTION:Are you a person who never tires of talking or thinking about 
 philosophical\, scientific or religious theories? Are you interested in ps
 ychological insights\, or attempts at such insights\, into human life? The
 re are many who would insist that being realistic about human life means y
 ou should ignore such fundamental questions—starting around the time the
  ink dries on your diploma. But it is unrealistic to ignore the fundamenta
 l explanatory concepts that underlie each successful human civilization—
 concepts that sometimes help and sometimes hinder us in our pursuit of hap
 piness.\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/20
 26-09-03/imperfect-circles-discussion-group-orinda-library
LOCATION:Orinda Public Library\, 26 Orinda Way\, Orinda\, CA
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-09-03/imperfect-circles-d
 iscussion-group-orinda-library
END:VEVENT
