BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trump 2.0 and Europe: Crisis\, Catalyst or Both?
DTSTART:20260918T020000Z
DTEND:20260918T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T110827Z
UID:07fdde8c-280c-5ef4-9539-10bfe7904b78
DESCRIPTION:Nearly two years into the second Trump administration\, we can
  ask: How has the EU fared during the first two years of Trump 2.0? For de
 cades\, Europe prospered within an international order built around Americ
 an security guarantees\, expanding global trade and close transatlantic co
 operation. Today\, trade disputes\, Ukraine\, migration\, conflicts in the
  Middle East\, European security\, and competition over AI and the digital
  economy are testing that relationship and Europe's ability to respond. 
 \n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-09-1
 7/trump-20-and-europe-crisis-catalyst-or-both
LOCATION:Dominican University\, The Creekside Room\, San Rafael\, CA
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-09-17/trump-20-and-europe
 -crisis-catalyst-or-both
END:VEVENT
