DESCRIPTION:Climate One is headed to NYC! If you live in the area\, join u
 s for a live event in New York City during New York Climate Week.\nWhen it
  comes to policy\, New York is a climate leader. But living here is freaki
 ng expensive. So what does it take to live affordably in NYC and be climat
 e-conscious? How do you pay rent and invest in an induction stove? How can
  a home battery help with electric bills? What about heat protections for 
 those who work outdoors? And even if you can swing an EV car\, where the h
 eck are you supposed to charge it?\n\nMore info & tickets: https://www.com
 monwealthclub.org/events/2026-09-23/climate-one-grist-live-new-york-climat
 e-week-you-good-making-nyc-green-and
